## Communication Checkpoints Across Workflows

| Checkpoint | Who | When | Format |
|------------|-----|------|--------|
| Refinement | PM, Dev, Tech Lead | Before sprint | Slack + meeting notes |
| Sprint Planning | Entire team | Week start | Meeting + Jira/board update |
| Daily Standup | Entire team | Daily | 15-min sync |
| Mid-sprint Check-in | PM, Tech Lead, Scrum Master | Mid-sprint | Async update + optional sync |
| Sprint Review / Demo | Team + Stakeholders | Sprint end | Meeting + recording |
| Retrospective | Team | Sprint end + 1 week | Meeting + action items |
| Status Update | PM + Stakeholders | Weekly | Email or dashboard |
| Risk Review | PM, Project Manager, Team Leads | Weekly | Meeting or async |
| Release Planning | PM, Dev, QA, DevOps, Project Manager | 2 weeks pre-release | Kick-off meeting |
| Release Coordination | Project Manager, DevOps, QA, Product Manager | Release day | Real-time Slack |

